            ]
          ],
          "id": "Q1_s3_results_b3",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "original_problem",
            "R12_source",
            "frozen_results"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "writing_role": "interpretation",
          "text": "平均性能随可用核数增加而提升。五核最小相对REF加速比仍为{{value:A.k5.min_speedup}}，但并非对其他启发式逐例必胜：相对冻结C3，五核为{{value:C3.A.k5.wins}}例更快、{{value:C3.A.k5.ties}}例持平、{{value:C3.A.k5.losses}}例更慢。逐图计算1−T_R12/T_C3后取平均，执行时间减少{{value:C3.A.k5.time_reduction_percent}}%；该比例不是求解程序墙钟下降率，也不能归因于单一新模块。",
          "id": "Q1_s3_results_b4",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "original_problem",
            "R12_source",
            "frozen_results"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "writing_role": "results",
          "caption": "新增COPY的分解与完整请求成本（五核100图）",
          "headers": [
            "量",
            "结果"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "平均新增COPY／MiB",
              "{{value:A.k5.mean_added_MiB}}"
            ],
            [
              "平均partition新增／MiB",
